Sync None
Create Near
Expunge Near
CopyArrivalDate yes

MaildirStore home
Path ~/Maildir/
Inbox ~/Maildir/INBOX
Trash ~/Maildir/Trash
SubFolders Verbatim

IMAPStore me@linabee.uk
Host imap.fastmail.com
UserCmd "kwallet-query kdewallet --read-password fastmail-email"
PassCmd "kwallet-query kdewallet --read-password fastmail-imap"
TLSType IMAPS

Channel pull
Far :me@linabee.uk:
Near :home:
Sync Full
MaxMessages 0
Patterns INBOX Sent Archive

Channel push
Far :me@linabee.uk:
Near :home:
Sync Push PullFlags PullGone
Patterns Trash Drafts

Group me@linabee.uk pull push
